{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kristofferremback/seer/pulls/3","id":4085184743,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTZUlPc7zfvjn","html_url":"https://github.com/kristofferremback/seer/pull/3","diff_url":"https://github.com/kristofferremback/seer/pull/3.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kristofferremback/seer/pull/3.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kristofferremback/seer/issues/3","number":3,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Image uploads: WebP compression, immutable URLs, GitHub camo carve-out","user":{"login":"kristofferremback","id":9280031,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODAwMzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9280031?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kristofferremback","html_url":"https://github.com/kristofferremback","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kristofferremback/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kristofferremback/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kristofferremback/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kristofferremback/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kristofferremback/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kristofferremback/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kristofferremback/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kristofferremback/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kristofferremback/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nA new **images** path alongside bundles: upload a single image, get a permanent URL that renders in GitHub PRs/issues/READMEs.\n\n- `PUT /api/images/<filename>` — raw bytes as the body, same `seer_sk_…` bearer keys; the key resolves the workspace. Response includes a ready-to-paste `markdown` field.\n- `GET /api/images` — the key's workspace inventory.\n- Served at `/<ws>/i/<img_id>/<filename>` with `cache-control: immutable`; each upload mints a fresh random `img_` id (50 bits), so URLs never change and are unguessable.\n\n## Compression (ported from Threa)\n\nsharp on upload: EXIF orientation baked in, longest edge capped at 2000px, metadata stripped, re-encoded WebP q82 (animated GIFs stay animated). If the WebP is no smaller, the original is stored untouched; SVG always passes through. The repo's own `og.png` goes 62 KB → 15 KB.\n\n## Visibility\n\nFollows the workspace like bundles (public → anyone with the link, private → members only, indistinguishable soft-404 otherwise) — with one deliberate exception: **GitHub's camo image proxy is always served**, so an image embedded in a PR renders even from a private workspace. Camo is identified by User-Agent, which is spoofable; the docs frame private image URLs as capability links (same model as GitHub's user-images).\n\n## Plumbing\n\n- Schema v2 migration: additive `images` table, idempotent, prod's v1 db upgrades on boot.\n- Blobs at `DATA_DIR/images/<ws>/<img_id>`; db row carries filename/content-type/bytes.\n- SVG served with a script-neutering CSP; magic-byte sniff + sharp decode give actionable 400s.\n- skill.md, README, CLAUDE.md updated.\n\n## Tests\n\n105 pass (was 97): upload/compress/serve round-trip (served bytes decoded and dimension-checked), 2000px cap, workspace scoping, soft-404 strictness, and the member/stranger/anon/camo matrix in the real-auth subprocess script.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-07-19T07:56:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T08:12:28Z","closed_at":"2026-07-19T08:12:28Z","merged_at":"2026-07-19T08:12:27Z","merge_commit_sha":"05864a9400c90ab6394290017da50f609fcbe89c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kristofferremback/seer/pulls/3/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kristofferremback/seer/pulls/3/comments","r